{"id":"77zzyzj","title":"ePOD System Structure","titleAuto":false,"color":"#5a7d3a","rootId":"rx6733u","nodes":{"rx6733u":{"id":"rx6733u","text":"ePOD System","parent":null,"x":0,"y":0,"side":"root","color":"#fff","w":168.63277534892288,"h":49.62239308250819,"updated":1795369948150},"p4nw4g8":{"id":"p4nw4g8","text":"Master Data","parent":"rx6733u","x":238.63277534892288,"y":-438.6289143130008,"side":"right","created":1795369952001,"color":"#d8e0fb","w":118.68486572862261,"h":39.90885246228135,"updated":1795369971596,"collapsed":false},"ri760nc":{"id":"ri760nc","text":"Customers","parent":"p4nw4g8","x":427.3176410775455,"y":-531.4921955630008,"side":"right","created":1795369975249,"color":"#ffedc2","w":109.62239583333334,"h":39.90885416666667,"updated":1795369977871,"collapsed":false},"gppdbuo":{"id":"gppdbuo","text":"Sites","parent":"p4nw4g8","x":427.3176410775455,"y":-469.5833413963341,"side":"right","created":1795370457900,"color":"#ffedc2","w":67.36979166666667,"h":39.90885416666667,"updated":1795370460588,"notes":"<ul><li>Consider one-to-many scenario, e.g. store site once and allocate to multiple customers. Benefit is reduced data for duplicate sites under different customers. UI/UX would need to be extremely clear when updating things like email addresses, to make sure they know it may impact more than 1 customer.</li><li>If doing the above, for customers that only ever have a one-to-one relationship, we could prefix all unique site references with the CustomerCode (e.g. via the API)</li></ul>"},"siohvr0":{"id":"siohvr0","text":"Job Structure","parent":"rx6733u","x":238.63277534892288,"y":-252.9023535173861,"side":"right","created":1795370714032,"color":"#ffe2d6","w":126.96614583333334,"h":39.90885416666667,"updated":1795370721926,"collapsed":false},"qhkpprz":{"id":"qhkpprz","text":"Stages","parent":"siohvr0","x":435.5989211822562,"y":-252.9023535173861,"side":"right","created":1795370747839,"color":"#efd9f2","w":80.79427083333334,"h":39.90885416666667,"updated":1795370759315,"collapsed":false},"zw3jvwo":{"id":"zw3jvwo","text":"Items","parent":"qhkpprz","x":586.3931920155895,"y":-283.85678060071945,"side":"right","created":1795370833153,"color":"#cfe9e6","w":71.58854166666667,"h":39.90885416666667,"updated":1795370834566,"notes":"<ul><li>Store items under stages to allow multi-collect, multi-deliver stages. E.g. collect 10 items at first collection, then 2 more stages each delivering 5 items. Storing items at \"Job\" level doesn't allow this</li><li>Consider nesting \"Items\", e.g. top level item is \"Pallets\" then lower level items are the individual product lines. Calidus did this well from memory (Ask Matt T).&nbsp;</li><li>Consider nested items being optionally hidden to driver, e.g. driver may be delivering \"Pallets\" without knowledge of what is in them, but the customer requires a POD for the products rather than the \"Pallets\"</li></ul>"},"0x65npx":{"id":"0x65npx","text":"Stage Types","parent":"qhkpprz","x":586.3931920155895,"y":-221.94792643405276,"side":"right","created":1795371151181,"color":"#ffe2d6","w":118.95833333333334,"h":39.90885416666667,"updated":1795371165212,"notes":"E.g.<div><ul><li>Collect</li><li>Deliver</li><li>Trunk</li><li>Changeover</li></ul><div>Certain \"Types\" may carry restrictions or configuration, e.g. a \"Trunk\" stage may not need the user to indicate items against them, as the action is implied by goods already on the vehicle.&nbsp;</div></div><div><br></div><div>Process could go:</div><div><ul><li>Collect 10 items</li><li>Deliver 5 items</li><li>Trunk 5 items (implied by only 5 left on Vehicle)</li><li>Deliver 5 items</li></ul></div>"},"zs3s043":{"id":"zs3s043","text":"Items","parent":"p4nw4g8","x":427.3176410775455,"y":-407.6744872296674,"side":"right","created":1795372124531,"color":"#ffedc2","w":71.58854166666667,"h":39.90885416666667,"updated":1795372132353,"notes":"<ul><li>Potentially store pricing here against Item, so it can be calculated during job creation etc if not known by other system at creation time.</li></ul>"},"eixh3k8":{"id":"eixh3k8","text":"Planning","parent":"rx6733u","x":238.63277534892288,"y":159.6289113172593,"side":"right","created":1795372423258,"color":"#dcefce","w":93.41146980804379,"h":39.90885246228135,"updated":1795372427890},"7f40j3w":{"id":"7f40j3w","text":"Allocated Orders","parent":"eixh3k8","x":402.04424515696667,"y":-67.17580937181887,"side":"right","created":1795372429491,"color":"#ffedc2","w":151.19799147987524,"h":39.908848776328234,"updated":1795372455829},"jvtzcps":{"id":"jvtzcps","text":"Unallocated Orders","parent":"eixh3k8","x":402.04424515696667,"y":180.45958158101962,"side":"right","created":1795372457469,"color":"#e9e2d6","w":169.45313837734474,"h":39.908870552042465,"updated":1795372465630},"1ygdgjs":{"id":"1ygdgjs","text":"Card View","parent":"7f40j3w","x":623.2422366368419,"y":-160.0390722673861,"side":"right","created":1795372476603,"color":"#cfe9e6","w":103.84114583333334,"h":39.90885416666667,"updated":1795372480113},"2hq7akd":{"id":"2hq7akd","text":"Gannt View","parent":"7f40j3w","x":623.2422366368419,"y":-98.13021810071943,"side":"right","created":1795372481534,"color":"#cfe9e6","w":112.90364583333334,"h":39.90885416666667,"updated":1795372498140},"mfpngqj":{"id":"mfpngqj","text":"Table View","parent":"7f40j3w","x":623.2422366368419,"y":-36.22136393405276,"side":"right","created":1795372510126,"color":"#cfe9e6","w":107.34375183209407,"h":39.908848776328234,"updated":1795372516240},"n5gxbjy":{"id":"n5gxbjy","text":"Map View","parent":"7f40j3w","x":623.2422366368419,"y":25.687484842275474,"side":"right","created":1795372533535,"color":"#cfe9e6","w":101.2890523085321,"h":39.908817457801106,"updated":1795372537477},"g3kzskg":{"id":"g3kzskg","text":"Card View","parent":"jvtzcps","x":641.4973835343114,"y":87.59630230007659,"side":"right","created":1795372552488,"color":"#d8e0fb","w":103.84118630204192,"h":39.908870552042465,"updated":1795372556278},"5qmu0ko":{"id":"5qmu0ko","text":"Gannt Vi